workedExamples.question_text:
The ogive shows the travel times of 60 commuters. Estimate the median travel time.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1mm,y=1mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\draw[step=10mm,color=gray!40,thin] (0,0) grid (60,60);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(63,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,63);
\foreach \v in {0,10,20,30,40,50,60} {
\draw[black] (\v,0)--(\v,-1);
\path (\v,-1) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\v$};
}
\foreach \v in {10,20,30,40,50,60} {
\draw[black] (0,\v)--(-1,\v);
\path (-1,\v) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\v$};
}
\draw[black,thick] (0,0)--(10,6)--(20,18)--(30,42)--(40,54)--(50,60);
\foreach \p in {(0,0),(10,6),(20,18),(30,42),(40,54),(50,60)} {\fill[black] \p circle (0.6mm);}
\path (30,-9) node {Travel time (min)};
\path (-12,30) node[rotate=90] {Cumulative frequency};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

workedExamples.solution_text:
$\begin{align*}\text{50\% line}&=0.5\times60\\&=30\end{align*}$

Read horizontally from cumulative frequency 30 to the ogive, then down to the travel-time axis.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1mm,y=1mm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black}]
\definecolor{medianGuide}{HTML}{ef6068}
\draw[step=10mm,color=gray!40,thin] (0,0) grid (60,60);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(63,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,63);
\foreach \v in {0,10,20,30,40,50,60} {
\draw[black] (\v,0)--(\v,-1);
\path (\v,-1) node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\v$};
}
\foreach \v in {10,20,30,40,50,60} {
\draw[black] (0,\v)--(-1,\v);
\path (-1,\v) node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$\v$};
}
\draw[black,thick] (0,0)--(10,6)--(20,18)--(30,42)--(40,54)--(50,60);
\foreach \p in {(0,0),(10,6),(20,18),(30,42),(40,54),(50,60)} {\fill[black] \p circle (0.6mm);}
\draw[medianGuide,dashed,thick] (0,30)--(25,30)--(25,0);
\path (27,24) node[right,text=medianGuide] {Median guides};
\path (25,-1) node[below,text=medianGuide,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] {$25$};
\path (30,-9) node {Travel time (min)};
\path (-12,30) node[rotate=90] {Cumulative frequency};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

The estimated median travel time is $25\text{ min}$.

